/* libneth.so's old names (lane/neth-refactor): each nwrl_* function the library exported before the rename, an alias of
 * its neth_ name, for the trainers that load the library by the old names (mcsr-speedrun's ctypes binding, through the
 * libnwrl.so link beside libneth.so). An input of the link (rlbind.mk); drop a line once nothing calls the old name. */
